@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = replace-with-manager-or-admin-access-token

### Manager dashboard report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/dashboard?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-09-01&currency=VND
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Invalid range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/dashboard?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-08-01
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
